cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "LeafArea & LAI Analyzer: Deterministic Scientific Leaf Surface Area and Leaf Area Index Pipeline"
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
version: "1.5.6"
date-released: "2026-10-26"
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "LeafArea & LAI Research Team"
keywords:
  - leaf area
  - leaf area index
  - LAI
  - plant phenotyping
  - image analysis
  - OpenCV
  - scientific software
abstract: >-
  A deterministic, zero-click desktop and web application that measures one-sided leaf
  surface area (cm²) from full-resolution photos or flatbed scans and calculates the
  Leaf Area Index (LAI), with automatic scale calibration, masked normalized-convolution
  illumination correction, and explicit edge-uncertainty reporting.
